---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { localizedPath } from '@/i18n/utils';

const lang = 'en';
---

<BaseLayout lang={lang} title="Shabo">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Shabo</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Village in Bilhorod-Dnistrovskyi rayon, Odesa oblast. Settlement KATOTTG from SDMX research:
      <code>UA51040310010035609</code>.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2>Economy and tourism</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>SHABO company and the <strong>Wine Culture Centre</strong> (opened 2009 per SHABO and Wikipedia).</li>
        <li>Ekonomichna Pravda describes the company as town-forming and supporting village upkeep.</li>
        <li>
          <strong>60–70 thousand visitors per year</strong> — attributed to the company in Ekonomichna Pravda (December 2023); media quote, not Derzhstat.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Data on this site</h2>
      <p>
        Oblast-level wine/grape SDMX flows (e.g. <code>DF_ARRIVAL_GRAPES_WINE_MATERIALS</code>) do not break out Shabo village.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="sources">
      <h2>Sources</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://epravda.com.ua/publications/2023/12/19/707732/" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ekonomichna Pravda — SHABO (incl. visitors)</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://shabo.ua/centr-kulturi-vina/" rel="noopener noreferrer">SHABO — Wine Culture Centre</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/Центр_культури_вина_Шабо" rel="noopener noreferrer">Wikipedia (uk) — Wine Culture Centre Shabo</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <p><a href={localizedPath('/cases/', lang)}>← All cases</a></p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
